    "title": "Unraveling the folding-assisted unbinding mechanism of TCF with its binding partner beta-catenin."
  },
  "content": {
    "abstract": "This study utilizes molecular dynamics simulations aided with multiple walker parallel bias metadynamics to investigate the TCF unbinding mechanism from the beta-catenin interface. The results, consistent with experimental binding affinity calculations, unveil a folding-assisted unbinding mechanism.",
